s15:s1,s7,i14:syl2anc |- ( ( C e. RR /\ N e. ( ZZ>= ` 3 ) ) -> ( C zscale N ) = ( Nceil ` ( ( C x. ( ell2 ` N ) ) x. ( ell3 ` N ) ) ) )
